 over small towns in rural Montana","target":"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/f95be18ba9a316a8f763c5b3bce9dd9ddab1c6d5/26_0_1448_869/master/1448.jpg?width=620&dpr=2&s=none&crop=none","line":42,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Ubisoft games are political, says CEO - just not the way you think","source":"https://www.theguardian.com/games/2018/jun/25/ubisoft-tom-clancy-division-2-politics-criticism","author":["[[Keith Stuart]]"],"published":"2018-06-25","created":"2026-03-30","description":"Ubisoft’s CEO, Yves Guillemot, answers recent criticism that the company has been dodging the political implications of its games, saying they give players the tools to explore issues themselves","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1fkbfo5","at":1779670472918},"key":"Clippings/Ubisoft games are political, says CEO - just not the way you think.md"},
